      "content": "i see. so even though their actual school performance (GPA and attendance) is exactly the same, you're saying the demographic and zip code stuff makes Student B a higher risk for disciplinary issues? why is that? wouldn't the academic data be the most accurate way to see if they're actually struggling?",
